
% Building a Mystery

a: vi | IV | I | V |
link: vi | IV | I | V |
In: $a*2
Vr: $a*4
turnaround: II | IV | V |
turnaround_2: II | IV | II | IV | V |
a_cad: V |
Ch: $a*4
bridge: IV | V | IV | ii | IV | V | IV | ii | IV | V |
PostCh: $a*8
S: [D] $In $Vr $turnaround $link $Vr $turnaround_2 $Ch $a_cad $Vr $turnaround_2 $Ch $bridge $Ch
